      "_id": "6855d89432ecade4c7b8af29",
      "step": "To make ginger tea, slice ginger into thin rounds. (No need to peel the ginger.) Add ginger to a small saucepan of water and bring to a boil. Remove from heat and let steep for 8-10 minutes. Suggest to make the tea extra-strong, since you can always dilute it with water later."
    },
